We, of course, act as
consultants internally.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:51.610
We help a lot of teams again,
mostly in cloud and GCP,

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.590
but even in other areas.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.650
Teams that are dealing with
complex issues pertaining

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.930
to data visualization-- maybe
