00:26:20.460 --> 00:26:20.900
MANUEL LIMA: Thank you so much.

00:26:20.900 --> 00:26:21.933
GABI FERRARA: Obrigado.

00:26:21.933 --> 00:26:22.850
MANUEL LIMA: Obrigado.

